        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireside Journey: The Creative Path of Fireside Feelings</strong> is an interactive experience that takes you deep into the making of <i>Fireside Feelings</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001900/extras/d9f98a33119678a714822427f96cc5db.avif?t=1761066669\" width=800 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the controls of a little red train, you travel from station to station, each one dedicated to a key moment in development: inspirations, doubts, joys, and artistic choices. At every stop, the creators share their stories, emotions, and reflections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001900/extras/b1065e521e9ef45ddeb9d63505d532c4.avif?t=1761066669\" width=800 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, explore new environments tied to the world of the game: Étincelle’s hometown, the landscapes that inspired our settings, and the characters you’ve come to love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll also be able to <strong>find and invite beloved Fireside Feelings characters</strong> to join your train, and <strong>uncover hidden objects</strong> that unlock exclusive tutorials to learn how to draw the game’s heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001900/extras/261bc1e03c102e6cc1e87854699597d1.avif?t=1761066669\" width=800 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireside Journey</strong> is, above all, a love letter to our community: an interactive artbook created to share our creative path and extend the adventure together. And because this project exists thanks to you, <strong>all proceeds will go directly to the development team, to support the continuation of our shared journey.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireside Journey: The Creative Path of Fireside Feelings</strong> is an interactive experience that takes you deep into the making of <i>Fireside Feelings</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001900/extras/d9f98a33119678a714822427f96cc5db.avif?t=1761066669\" width=800 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the controls of a little red train, you travel from station to station, each one dedicated to a key moment in development: inspirations, doubts, joys, and artistic choices. At every stop, the creators share their stories, emotions, and reflections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001900/extras/b1065e521e9ef45ddeb9d63505d532c4.avif?t=1761066669\" width=800 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, explore new environments tied to the world of the game: Étincelle’s hometown, the landscapes that inspired our settings, and the characters you’ve come to love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll also be able to <strong>find and invite beloved Fireside Feelings characters</strong> to join your train, and <strong>uncover hidden objects</strong> that unlock exclusive tutorials to learn how to draw the game’s heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001900/extras/261bc1e03c102e6cc1e87854699597d1.avif?t=1761066669\" width=800 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireside Journey</strong> is, above all, a love letter to our community: an interactive artbook created to share our creative path and extend the adventure together. And because this project exists thanks to you, <strong>all proceeds will go directly to the development team, to support the continuation of our shared journey.</strong></p>",
